@startuml
!theme plain
title Transaction Risk Analysis — Kafka, DLQ and Signature Service
participant "Integration Platform" as Integration
queue "Kafka" as Kafka
participant "Antifraud Engine" as Fraud
queue "Dead Letter Queue" as DLQ
participant "Signature Service" as Signer
Integration -> Kafka : Publish AnalysisRequested(eventId, correlation)
Kafka -> Fraud : Deliver analysis request
alt Technical processing failure
  Fraud -> DLQ : Quarantine message with reason
else Successful risk assessment
  Fraud -> Fraud : Evaluate configured risk rules
  Fraud -> Kafka : Publish AnalysisResult(decision, riskScore)
  Kafka -> Integration : Deliver analysis result
  alt Integration cannot process response
    Integration -> DLQ : Durable quarantine
  else Valid result
    Integration -> Integration : Form response to requesting party
    Integration -> Signer : Submit normalized signing request
    Signer --> Integration : Signed result / file reference
    Integration -> Integration : Record final delivery state
  end
end
note over Integration,Kafka
Source diagram says "create topic" per request.
Public edition models publishing to a pre-provisioned topic.
end note
@enduml